The try-on model weights are the original FASHN VTON v1.5 weights,
downloaded at runtime from https://huggingface.co/fashn-ai/fashn-vton-1.5.
They have not been retrained or fine-tuned.

Modifications made in this distribution:
- Renamed the package (fashn_vton -> kapadiya_ai) and project branding.
- Streaming, meta-device checkpoint loading (low host RAM).
- Automatic precision selection (bf16 / fp16 / fp32) and a low-VRAM mode.
- Interval classifier-free guidance, speed presets, and a 576x384 preview resolution.
- Cached RoPE tables and garment preprocessing.
- Warm-start sampling, a live webcam app, a CLI, and a benchmark script.

Third-party components:
- FLUX.1 components by Black Forest Labs (Apache-2.0)
- DWPose (Apache-2.0), YOLOX (Apache-2.0)
- fashn-human-parser (see https://github.com/fashn-AI/fashn-human-parser#license)
